# 类型安全导航架构

## 核心概念

SwiftUI 的导航经历了三代演进：NavigationView（iOS 13，已废弃）→ NavigationStack/NavigationSplitView（iOS 16）→ SwiftUI 6 的增强型类型安全路由。当前最佳实践是将导航状态建模为枚举路由，配合 `NavigationPath` 实现程序化跳转、深链接解析和状态恢复。核心设计原则：**导航是状态，不是行为**——页面栈的每一帧都应该是可序列化、可回溯、可测试的数据。

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    DeepLink[URL / Push Notification] --> Router
    Router[AppRouter @Observable] -->|append route| NavPath[NavigationPath]
    NavPath --> NavStack[NavigationStack]
    NavStack -->|.navigationDestination| RouteSwitch{Route Enum Switch}
    RouteSwitch --> PageA[ProductList]
    RouteSwitch --> PageB[ProductDetail]
    RouteSwitch --> PageC[Cart]
    RouteSwitch --> PageD[Settings]
```

| 导航方式                      | 适用场景          | 状态管理                                |
| ----------------------------- | ----------------- | --------------------------------------- |
| NavigationStack + Path        | 线性栈式导航      | `NavigationPath` 或 `[Route]`           |
| NavigationSplitView           | iPad/Mac 多栏布局 | sidebar + detail 双绑定                 |
| `.sheet` / `.fullScreenCover` | 模态弹出          | `@State` / `@Presents` Bool 或 Optional |
| TabView                       | 顶级标签页切换    | `@State selection`                      |
| WindowGroup (visionOS/macOS)  | 多窗口            | `@Environment(\.openWindow)`            |

## 路由枚举设计

将所有可能的导航目标建模为 `Hashable` 枚举，每个 case 携带该页面的最小输入参数：

```swift
enum AppRoute: Hashable {
    case productList
    case productDetail(productId: String)
    case cart
    case checkout
    case orderConfirmation(orderId: String)
    case settings
    case profile(userId: String)
}
```

枚举的优势：编译器保证 `switch` 穷尽、新增页面自动要求处理、与 `Codable` 配合实现状态持久化。

## Router 模式实现

用 `@Observable` 类封装路由逻辑，与 View 层解耦：

```swift
@Observable
final class AppRouter {
    var path = NavigationPath()
    var presentedSheet: AppRoute?
    var presentedFullScreen: AppRoute?

    func navigate(to route: AppRoute) {
        path.append(route)
    }

    func pop() {
        guard !path.isEmpty else { return }
        path.removeLast()
    }

    func popToRoot() {
        path.removeLast(path.count)
    }

    func handleDeepLink(_ url: URL) {
        guard let components = URLComponents(url: url, resolvingAgainstBaseURL: true) else { return }
        switch components.host {
        case "product":
            let id = components.queryItems?.first { $0.name == "id" }?.value ?? ""
            popToRoot()
            navigate(to: .productList)
            navigate(to: .productDetail(productId: id))
        case "cart":
            popToRoot()
            navigate(to: .cart)
        default:
            break
        }
    }
}
```

## View 层绑定

```swift
struct RootView: View {
    @State private var router = AppRouter()

    var body: some View {
        NavigationStack(path: $router.path) {
            HomeView()
                .navigationDestination(for: AppRoute.self) { route in
                    switch route {
                    case .productList:
                        ProductListView()
                    case .productDetail(let id):
                        ProductDetailView(productId: id)
                    case .cart:
                        CartView()
                    case .checkout:
                        CheckoutView()
                    case .orderConfirmation(let id):
                        OrderConfirmationView(orderId: id)
                    case .settings:
                        SettingsView()
                    case .profile(let id):
                        ProfileView(userId: id)
                    }
                }
        }
        .environment(router)
        .onOpenURL { url in
            router.handleDeepLink(url)
        }
        .sheet(item: $router.presentedSheet) { route in
            // modal presentation
        }
    }
}
```

## NavigationPath 序列化与状态恢复

`NavigationPath` 遵循 `Codable`（当所有压入的类型也遵循 `Codable` 时），可直接持久化到 UserDefaults 或 SwiftData：

```swift
extension AppRouter {
    private static let pathKey = "savedNavigationPath"

    func save() {
        guard let data = try? JSONEncoder().encode(path.codable) else { return }
        UserDefaults.standard.set(data, forKey: Self.pathKey)
    }

    func restore() {
        guard let data = UserDefaults.standard.data(forKey: Self.pathKey),
              let decoded = try? JSONDecoder().decode(
                  NavigationPath.CodableRepresentation.self, from: data
              ) else { return }
        path = NavigationPath(decoded)
    }
}
```

## TCA 中的导航

TCA 使用 `@Presents` + `ifLet` / `forEach` 管理模态和栈式导航：

```swift
@Reducer
struct AppFeature {
    @ObservableState
    struct State {
        var path = StackState<Path.State>()
    }

    enum Action {
        case path(StackActionOf<Path>)
        case goToDetailTapped(String)
    }

    @Reducer
    enum Path {
        case detail(DetailFeature)
        case settings(SettingsFeature)
    }

    var body: some ReducerOf<Self> {
        Reduce { state, action in
            switch action {
            case .goToDetailTapped(let id):
                state.path.append(.detail(DetailFeature.State(id: id)))
                return .none
            case .path:
                return .none
            }
        }
        .forEach(\.path, action: \.path)
    }
}
```

## NavigationSplitView 多栏适配

iPad 和 macOS 应用需要 sidebar + detail 的双栏或三栏布局：

```swift
struct SplitNavView: View {
    @State private var selectedCategory: Category?
    @State private var selectedItem: Item?

    var body: some View {
        NavigationSplitView {
            CategoryListView(selection: $selectedCategory)
        } content: {
            if let category = selectedCategory {
                ItemListView(category: category, selection: $selectedItem)
            }
        } detail: {
            if let item = selectedItem {
                ItemDetailView(item: item)
            } else {
                ContentUnavailableView("选择一个项目", systemImage: "doc")
            }
        }
    }
}
```

## 小结

- 导航状态建模为枚举路由，享受编译时穷尽检查和 Codable 序列化
- Router 模式将跳转逻辑从 View 中抽离，支持程序化导航和深链接
- NavigationPath 序列化实现应用被 kill 后的精确状态恢复
- TCA 用 StackState + Reducer enum 管理类型安全的栈式导航
- iPad/Mac 用 NavigationSplitView，手机用 NavigationStack，共享路由逻辑

